    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "C89E2A602C505612",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同學，請到這邊來。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2010_botan_01",
      "hash64": "6EFA018564701DE7",
      "text": "這是要挨罵了嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2010_rival_01",
      "hash64": "461E8343EF8A3D25",
      "text": "誰知道呢？[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "C89E29602C50545F",
      "text": "我怎麼會罵各位呢。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "C89E28602C5052AC",
      "text": "是關於各位的校外研究，\\n也就是尋寶的成就。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_04a",
      "hash64": "350D806B4C78F248",
      "text": "各位關閉了時光機……\\n並且阻止了古代的寶可夢們失控。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_04b",
      "hash64": "350D836B4C78F761",
      "text": "各位關閉了時光機……\\n並且阻止了未來的寶可夢們失控。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_05",
      "hash64": "C89E26602C504F46",
      "text": "那真的是非常卓越的行動。\\n讓我這個校長也很驕傲呢。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "C89E25602C504D93",
      "text": "雖然未經許可就闖入禁止進入的地方，\\n這行為並不可取……[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2010_rival_02",
      "hash64": "461E8043EF8A380C",
      "text": "啊哈哈……\\n您說的是～[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_07",
      "hash64": "C89E24602C504BE0",
      "text": "但鑑於各位保護了\\n帕底亞豐富的生態系，\\r\\n這件事我就不追究了。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2010_botan_02",
      "hash64": "6EFA028564701F9A",
      "text": "呼～沒挨罵。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_11",
      "hash64": "C89AA6602C4D3FEF",
      "text": "……哎呀！\\n這東西就只差[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳還沒有拿到呢。\\r\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同學，請收下……[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_08",
      "hash64": "C89E33602C50655D",
      "text": "還有我之前交給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]名人堂徽章[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n是只有在學院作出傑出貢獻的學生\\r\\n才能擁有的東西。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_09",
      "hash64": "C89E32602C5063AA",
      "text": "在[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳今後的校園生活中，\\n要成為與那枚徽章相稱的好榜樣喔。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "common_2010_head_select_01",
      "hash64": "54390BCF9FB6D270",
      "text": "我會加油的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "common_2010_head_select_02",
      "hash64": "54390ECF9FB6D789",
      "text": "知道了……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_10a",
      "hash64": "2C055F6B4740F807",
      "text": "我很期待各位的未來呢。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_10b",
      "hash64": "2C05606B4740F9BA",
      "text": "哎呀……？\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是過度努力，以致於耗盡動力了嗎？[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_10",
      "hash64": "C89AA5602C4D3E3C",
      "text": "另外，派帕同學……\\n關於博士的事，我很遺憾。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "common_2010_friend_02",
      "hash64": "CA1E3553EEE110FA",
      "text": "嗯……謝謝……[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "common_2010_friend_03a",
      "hash64": "52691C9EE872F0A4",
      "text": "雖然知道媽已經死了的時候，\\n我真的很難過……[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "common_2010_friend_03b",
      "hash64": "52691F9EE872F5BD",
      "text": "雖然知道爸已經死了的時候，\\n我真的很難過……[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "common_2010_friend_04",
      "hash64": "CA1E2F53EEE106C8",
      "text": "但現在卻莫名其妙地有種\\n雨過天晴的感覺。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "common_2010_friend_05",
      "hash64": "CA1E3053EEE1087B",
      "text": "關於我媽的研究……\\n她想做的事……\\r\\n我在巨坑裡也稍微能理解了。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "common_2010_friend_05b",
      "hash64": "5254379EE860C27B",
      "text": "關於我爸的研究……\\n他想做的事……\\r\\n我在巨坑裡也稍微能理解了。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "common_2010_friend_06",
      "hash64": "CA1E3153EEE10A2E",
      "text": "想要製作時光機這種\\n不得了的東西，\\r\\n哪來的功夫去照顧小孩嘛。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "common_2010_friend_07",
      "hash64": "CA1E3253EEE10BE1",
      "text": "所以我要跟從小到現在\\n一直纏著我的鬱悶感說再見！[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "common_2010_friend_08",
      "hash64": "CA1E2B53EEE0FFFC",
      "text": "然後和獒教父還有這些朋友們\\n好好享受到畢業為止的校園生活！[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_11a",
      "hash64": "2C08436B4742FE4A",
      "text": "不愧是奧琳博士出眾的兒子。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_11b",
      "hash64": "2C08426B4742FC97",
      "text": "不愧是弗圖博士出眾的兒子。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_12",
      "hash64": "C89AA7602C4D41A2",
      "text": "……不過，畢業所需的學分，\\n你還差了一大截呢。\\r\\n請瘋狂賭命地努力吧。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "common_2010_friend_09",
      "hash64": "CA1E2C53EEE101AF",
      "text": "啥……？[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_13",
      "hash64": "C89AA8602C4D4355",
      "text": "另外，從本校新誕生了一位冠軍，\\n這也是可喜可賀的事情！[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_14",
      "hash64": "C89AA1602C4D3770",
      "text": "既然無法公開慶祝各位在巨坑的表現，\\n那麼這件喜事我們就大肆地\\r\\n和學院的大家一起慶祝吧。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "common_2010_rival_03",
      "hash64": "461E8143EF8A39BF",
      "text": "對了！對了！如果是這樣，\\n那我想舉辦寶可夢對戰大賽！！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "common_2010_friend_10",
      "hash64": "CA21B953EEE4271D",
      "text": "怎麼又提這種麻煩的事……[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "common_2010_botan_03",
      "hash64": "6EFA03856470214D",
      "text": "真是有夠妮莫。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_15",
      "hash64": "C89AA2602C4D3923",
      "text": "寶可夢對戰大賽……是嗎？[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_16",
      "hash64": "C89AA3602C4D3AD6",
      "text": "這似乎參雜了一些妮莫同學的\\n私心私慾，不過我覺得可以呢。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_17",
      "hash64": "C89AA4602C4D3C89",
      "text": "雖然會有其他學院活動的準備，\\n因此規模無法辦得太大……[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "common_2010_top_01",
      "hash64": "5E50D377DE760CD8",
      "text": "來龍去脈我都聽見了。[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "common_2010_top_02",
      "hash64": "5E50D677DE7611F1",
      "text": "那個大賽，就讓寶可夢聯盟\\n也助各位一臂之力吧。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "common_2010_rival_04",
      "hash64": "461E7E43EF8A34A6",
      "text": "首席！？[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "common_2010_head_teacher_18",
      "hash64": "C89AAD602C4D4BD4",
      "text": "哎呀哎呀，也慈，\\n那真是令人高興的提議。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "common_2010_top_03",
      "hash64": "5E50D577DE76103E",
      "text": "為了孕育年輕的才華，\\n我是全力相助，在所不惜的。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "common_2010_top_04",
      "hash64": "5E50D877DE761557",
      "text": "不過，在寶可夢這個領域中，\\n有成長潛力的可不只是新芽。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "common_2010_top_05",
      "hash64": "5E50D777DE7613A4",
      "text": "這所學校的老師包含了\\n曾擔任道館館主的人，圖鑑的開發者，\\r\\n以及許多擅長培育寶可夢的人。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "common_2010_top_06",
      "hash64": "5E50DA77DE7618BD",
      "text": "因此，我提議……[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "common_2010_top_07",
      "hash64": "5E50D977DE76170A",
      "text": "教師與學生！\\n全都齊聚一堂，\\r\\n分出校園最強的訓練家！[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "common_2010_rival_05",
      "hash64": "461E7F43EF8A3659",
      "text": "哇～！也能和老師對戰嗎！？\\n首席您當然也會上場吧！？[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "common_2010_friend_11",
      "hash64": "CA21B853EEE4256A",
      "text": "她是校外人士，不行吧？[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "common_2010_botan_04",
      "hash64": "6EF9FC8564701568",
      "text": "不不不，人家記得這個人\\n同時也是本校的理事長。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "common_2010_friend_12",
      "hash64": "CA21B753EEE423B7",
      "text": "真的假的……？\\n是無所不能超人派嗎……[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "common_2010_top_08",
      "hash64": "5E50CC77DE7600F3",
      "text": "冠軍妮莫，感謝妳的邀約。\\n要是大家不嫌棄的話，\\r\\n我是熱切地希望能參加……[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "common_2010_top_09",
      "hash64": "5E50CB77DE75FF40",
      "text": "但我的工作有點繁忙，\\n很難空出行程……[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "common_2010_rival_09",
      "hash64": "461E8B43EF8A4ABD",
      "text": "唉唷～！拜託您設法一下！！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "common_2010_top_10",
      "hash64": "5E4DCE77DE73CE82",
      "text": "若是冠軍[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳\\n願意幫忙我的工作，\\r\\n說不定我也能參加……？[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "common_2010_select_03",
      "hash64": "08BDAD9437783969",
      "text": "我願意幫忙！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "common_2010_select_04",
      "hash64": "08BDAE9437783B1C",
      "text": "要我做什麼呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "common_2010_top_11",
      "hash64": "5E4DCF77DE73D035",
      "text": "哦喔，感謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳，\\n冠軍[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "common_2010_top_12",
      "hash64": "5E4DCC77DE73CB1C",
      "text": "我希望[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳能代替我去\\n各地的道館視察。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "common_2010_top_13",
      "hash64": "5E4DCD77DE73CCCF",
      "text": "看看館主們是否能夠柔和引導\\n以冠軍級為目標的訓練家們……\\r\\n他們的實力是否有退步遜色……[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "label": "common_2010_top_14",
      "hash64": "5E4DCA77DE73C7B6",
      "text": "請作為冠軍去與道館館主們對戰，\\n並且鑑定他們的實力。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "label": "common_2010_top_15",
      "hash64": "5E4DCB77DE73C969",
      "text": "他們都是我所挑選的逸材，\\n基本上不會有什麼問題的。\\r\\n嗯，就是形式上去走一遭。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
